      <room>AW1.120</room>
      <slug></slug>
      <title>buildroot: flexible building of a custom embedded system</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Open Mobile Linux Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Buildroot is a nice, simple and efficient tool to build small to medium sized embedded Linux systems. It to automates the process of building a cross-compiling toolchain, the root filesystem with all userspace components, a Linux kernel image and a bootloader image.  It is used for embedded systems ranging from industrial controllers to hand-held media devices.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
      <description></description>
      <persons>
          <person id="321">Arnout Vandecappelle</person>
      </persons>
